<h2>DECLARATION OF TRUST</h2>

<p><strong>Opening Declaration.</strong> This Trust Agreement is made on {{fillOrBlank executionDate}} by
<strong>{{clientFullName}}</strong>, of {{personalInfo.address}}, {{personalInfo.city}},
{{personalInfo.county}} County, {{personalInfo.state}} {{personalInfo.zip}}
(the &ldquo;settlor,&rdquo; &ldquo;I,&rdquo; &ldquo;me,&rdquo; or &ldquo;my&rdquo;), as settlor and as initial trustee.</p>

<p><strong>Family.</strong>
{{#if (eq personalInfo.maritalStatus 'Married')}}I am married to {{fullName spouseInfo}}. [[DRAFT: intentional use of a separate rather than joint trust; elective share considerations]]
{{else if (eq personalInfo.maritalStatus 'Widowed')}}I am a widow or widower. [[DRAFT: reference to predeceased spouse if relevant]]
{{else if (eq personalInfo.maritalStatus 'Divorced')}}I am divorced. [[DRAFT: former spouse expressly excluded]]
{{else}}I am not married.{{/if}}
{{#hasItems children}}I have the following {{#if (gt children.length 1)}}children{{else}}child{{/if}}:</p>
<ul>
  {{#each children}}
  <li><strong>{{name}}</strong>, born {{formatDate dob}}{{#if isMinor}} (a minor){{/if}}{{#if specialNeeds}} &mdash; see <em>Administration of Special Needs Trust(s)</em>{{/if}}</li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>
<p>{{else}}I have no living children.</p><p>{{/hasItems}}
[[DRAFT: class-gift intent; after-born and adopted children; deliberate omissions]]</p>

