<h2>TRUSTEESHIP</h2>

<p><strong>Settlor as Initial Trustee.</strong> I shall serve as initial trustee. [[DRAFT: authority while serving]]</p>

{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.primary}}
<p><strong>Successor Trustee.</strong> On my death, resignation, or incapacity, <strong>{{fullName fiduciaries.trustee.primary}}</strong>{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.primary.relationship}}, {{fiduciaries.trustee.primary.relationship}}{{/if}}{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.primary.city}}, of {{fiduciaries.trustee.primary.city}}, {{fiduciaries.trustee.primary.state}}{{/if}}, shall serve as successor trustee.</p>
{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.alternate}}
<p><strong>Alternate Successor Trustee.</strong> <strong>{{fullName fiduciaries.trustee.alternate}}</strong>{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.alternate.relationship}}, {{fiduciaries.trustee.alternate.relationship}}{{/if}}.</p>
{{/if}}
{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.successor}}
<p><strong>Second Alternate Successor Trustee.</strong> <strong>{{fullName fiduciaries.trustee.successor}}</strong>{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.successor.relationship}}, {{fiduciaries.trustee.successor.relationship}}{{/if}}.</p>
{{/if}}
{{/if}}

<p><strong>Vacancy in Office.</strong> [[DRAFT: appointment mechanism when all named trustees are unable to serve]]</p>

{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.coTrustee}}
<p><strong>Co-trustees.</strong> <strong>{{fullName fiduciaries.trustee.coTrustee}}</strong>{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.coTrustee.relationship}}, {{fiduciaries.trustee.coTrustee.relationship}},{{/if}} shall serve as co-trustee. [[DRAFT: concurrent authority; deadlock resolution]]</p>
{{/if}}

<p><strong>{{#if fiduciaries.trustee.bondRequired}}Bond Required{{else}}Waiver of Bond{{/if}}.</strong> [[DRAFT: {{#if fiduciaries.trustee.bondRequired}}bond requirement{{else}}no trustee shall be required to post bond or other security{{/if}}]]</p>

